+# Notes App
+
+## Features
+- Add notes
+- Edit notes
+- Delete notes
+- Search notes
+
+## How to Use
+1. Open the app.
+2. Click 'Add Note' to create a new note.
+3. Enter your note and click 'Save'.
+4. To edit a note, click on it and make changes.
+5. Click 'Delete' to remove a note.
+6. Use the search bar to find specific notes.